##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub issue #3 (spec 017, US1) regression: visibility() silently no-ops
# under the JIT. numthreads 1 required: visibility() is a raytraced,
# RNG-adjacent lookup (trace-parameter sampleBase/bias defaults) -- same
# thread-scheduling-sensitivity confirmed for random() during issue #1's
# fix (two default-multithreaded interpreter renders of an RNG-driven
# scene differed by MaxBlockAvgDiff 163; forced to numthreads 1, diff 0.00).
version 3.03
Hider "reyes"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Option "limits" "numthreads" [1]
Display "sphere-visibility-reyes.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective"
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Surface "visibility_probe"
  Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
